OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by car in
OL,4,Astore car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after being hit
OL,7,Fby a car in a supermarket car park,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FSurrey Police said officers were called
OL,11,Fto the Tesco Extra store on Escot Road
OL,12,Fin Sunbury-on-Thames at around 15:00
OL,13,FGMT on Friday.
OL,15,FA man, aged in his 80s, died at the
OL,16,Fscene, said the force.
OL,18,FFire and ambulance services also
OL,19,Fattended the incident and the car park
OL,20,Fand store were closed until Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
